{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"create-a-project","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a Project"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npx @tanstack/cli create my-app","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Interactive prompts guide you through project name, package manager, and add-on selection."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"non-interactive","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Non-Interactive"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Defaults only (TanStack Start + file-router)\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app -y\n\n# Minimal one-route Start project\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --blank -y\n\n# Minimal Start project configured for Cloudflare\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --blank --deployment cloudflare -y\n\n# With add-ons\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --add-ons tanstack-query,clerk,drizzle -y\n\n# Router-only SPA (no SSR)\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --router-only -y","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Blank projects omit the default starter interface, examples, Tailwind,\ndevtools, test stack, and TanStack Intent setup. Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--intent"},{"type":"text","value":" to include\nlocal skill mappings for coding agents. Explicit add-ons can add their own\nrequired files and dependencies. Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"-y"},{"type":"text","value":" to skip selection prompts. A\nnon-empty target also requires "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--force"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"run-the-project","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Run the Project"}]},{"type":"code","value":"cd my-app\npnpm dev\n# Open http://localhost:3000","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"environment-variables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment Variables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Some add-ons require API keys. When the project includes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".env.example"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"cp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with your values","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"project-structure","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Project Structure"}]},{"type":"code","value":"my-app/\n├── src/\n│   ├── routes/          # File-based routing\n│   │   ├── __root.tsx   # Root layout\n│   │   └── index.tsx    # Home page\n│   └── integrations/    # Present when selected add-ons need it\n├── .cta.json            # CLI config\n└── .env.example         # Present when selected add-ons need env vars"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./cli-reference.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CLI Reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - All options"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./add-ons.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add-ons"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Available add-ons"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"create-a-project","text":"Create a Project","level":2},{"id":"non-interactive","text":"Non-Interactive","level":2},{"id":"run-the-project","text":"Run the Project","level":2},{"id":"environment-variables","text":"Environment Variables","level":2},{"id":"project-structure","text":"Project Structure","level":2},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Create a Project\n\n```bash\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n```\n\nInteractive prompts guide you through project name, package manager, and add-on selection.\n\n## Non-Interactive\n\n```bash\n# Defaults only (TanStack Start + file-router)\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app -y\n\n# Minimal one-route Start project\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --blank -y\n\n# Minimal Start project configured for Cloudflare\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --blank --deployment cloudflare -y\n\n# With add-ons\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --add-ons tanstack-query,clerk,drizzle -y\n\n# Router-only SPA (no SSR)\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --router-only -y\n```\n\nBlank projects omit the default starter interface, examples, Tailwind,\ndevtools, test stack, and TanStack Intent setup. Pass `--intent` to include\nlocal skill mappings for coding agents. Explicit add-ons can add their own\nrequired files and dependencies. Pass `-y` to skip selection prompts. A\nnon-empty target also requires `--force`.\n\n## Run the Project\n\n```bash\ncd my-app\npnpm dev\n# Open http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nSome add-ons require API keys. When the project includes `.env.example`:\n\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with your values\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-app/\n├── src/\n│   ├── routes/          # File-based routing\n│   │   ├── __root.tsx   # Root layout\n│   │   └── index.tsx    # Home page\n│   └── integrations/    # Present when selected add-ons need it\n├── .cta.json            # CLI config\n└── .env.example         # Present when selected add-ons need env vars\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [CLI Reference](./cli-reference.md) - All options\n- [Add-ons](./add-ons.md) - Available add-ons\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: quick-start\ntitle: Quick Start\n---\n\n## Create a Project\n\n```bash\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n```\n\nInteractive prompts guide you through project name, package manager, and add-on selection.\n\n## Non-Interactive\n\n```bash\n# Defaults only (TanStack Start + file-router)\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app -y\n\n# Minimal one-route Start project\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --blank -y\n\n# Minimal Start project configured for Cloudflare\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --blank --deployment cloudflare -y\n\n# With add-ons\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --add-ons tanstack-query,clerk,drizzle -y\n\n# Router-only SPA (no SSR)\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app --router-only -y\n```\n\nBlank projects omit the default starter interface, examples, Tailwind,\ndevtools, test stack, and TanStack Intent setup. Pass `--intent` to include\nlocal skill mappings for coding agents. Explicit add-ons can add their own\nrequired files and dependencies. Pass `-y` to skip selection prompts. A\nnon-empty target also requires `--force`.\n\n## Run the Project\n\n```bash\ncd my-app\npnpm dev\n# Open http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nSome add-ons require API keys. When the project includes `.env.example`:\n\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with your values\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-app/\n├── src/\n│   ├── routes/          # File-based routing\n│   │   ├── __root.tsx   # Root layout\n│   │   └── index.tsx    # Home page\n│   └── integrations/    # Present when selected add-ons need it\n├── .cta.json            # CLI config\n└── .env.example         # Present when selected add-ons need env vars\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [CLI Reference](./cli-reference.md) - All options\n- [Add-ons](./add-ons.md) - Available add-ons\n"}
